---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About" current="about" description="About Geoff Lane.">
  <main>
    <h1>About</h1>

    <div class="prose">
      <p class="lede">
        I'm Geoff Lane. I've been a professional software developer since 1999, working across a
        lot of different technologies and a lot of different places.
      </p>
      <p>
        Startups in Silicon Valley during the tail end of the dot-com boom, then Chicago. A
        consulting firm in Milwaukee. Custom software for clients out of Cincinnati. I've lived in
        Ohio twice, plus Wisconsin, Illinois, Texas, Virginia and California. Now Windsor,
        Ontario, with my wife, my son, and three cats.
      </p>
      <p>
        I've never been especially loyal to one language or paradigm — object-oriented and
        functional, static and dynamic, whatever the problem actually calls for. I like proven
        tools and I keep an eye on new ones. I prefer Unixy systems. I use Vim because it's
        awesome.
      </p>
      <p>
        Away from a keyboard: I cook and play guitar.
        I like heavy metal — At The Gates, Dark Tranquillity, In Flames, Lamb
        of God, High on Fire — though Johnny Cash and Dylan get their turns
        too.
        I've been to twelve countries so far. Not sure if I'll make it to more or not.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="elsewhere">
      <span class="label">Elsewhere</span>
      <div class="links">
        <a href="mailto:geoff@zorched.net">geoff@zorched.net</a>
        <a href="https://github.com/geofflane" rel="me">github.com/geofflane</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  main {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 44px;
    max-width: 640px;
    padding: clamp(48px, 7vw, 72px) 0;
  }

  h1 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(34px, 5vw, 44px);
    line-height: 1.1;
  }

  .prose {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 22px;
    font-size: 19px;
    line-height: 1.72;
  }

  .prose p {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .lede {
    color: var(--soft);
  }

  .elsewhere {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 20px;
    padding-top: 36px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }

  .label {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--faint);
  }

  .links {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
    font-size: 16px;
  }
</style>
